{
  "slug": "wooyun-legacy",
  "name": "WooYun Legacy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Web vulnerability testing methodology distilled from 88,636 real-world cases from the WooYun vulnerability database (2010-2016)",
  "longDescription": "Single `wooyun-legacy` skill backed by content distilled from **88,636 WooYun vulnerability database cases** (2010\u20132016), translated from Chinese and anonymized:\n\n- **Vulnerability reference docs** (8): SQL injection, XSS, command execution, file upload, path traversal, unauthorized access, info disclosure, logic flaws\n- **Testing checklists** (14): adds CSRF, SSRF, weak passwords, misconfiguration, RCE, XXE\n- **Case studies** (2): anonymized financial institution attack chain and telecom carrier penetration\n\nFor authorized security testing and educational use only.",
